<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Detect Magic</h1>
<p>Sphere: Detection Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Conjurer (guild level 0), Sorcerer (guild level 0)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast detect magic &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast detect magic</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>For a while after this spell, the target sees which things are magical: 
wherever a magical thing is listed, in a room, an inventory or a container, it 
shows a (yellow) aura. Cast it on yourself to check your own things and what 
lies around you, or on a friend.
</p><p>The better your detection sphere, the longer it lasts: from a minute up to 
several minutes. You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on 
scrolls and potions.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Identify</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detect Invisible</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detect Poison</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>